                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "d400d8ad-99b6-3f9d-b640-7f624bcf6301",
                        "entry_id": "1a51e42f-30b0-3d5c-9355-6e8b14456a13",
                        "glosses": [
                            "taki, któremu nie da się dorównać"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "2155936c-8f5a-43ee-8578-62f99bbbabab",
                                "sense_id": "d400d8ad-99b6-3f9d-b640-7f624bcf6301",
                                "text": "Teraz niedościgłym wzorem jest dla mnie oczywiście Francis Legrand, gwiazda światowego wspinania wyczynowego"
                            }
                        ],
                        "sense_index_json": "\"1.1\""
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "528849ca-2f2e-4754-89e5-4a9c30d4f66f",
                        "source_entry_id": "1a51e42f-30b0-3d5c-9355-6e8b14456a13",
                        "source_sense_id": "d400d8ad-99b6-3f9d-b640-7f624bcf6301",
                        "target_lang_word": "inimitable",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "inimitable",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "94888005-eb27-305b-80bd-c8be73360d85",
                                        "entry_id": "3fc55e56-f377-3689-b3b6-d4fcb28104ed",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Beyond imitation, surpassing all others; matchless."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "03da3883-76ab-4a57-bb2c-05f03807378f",
                                                "sense_id": "94888005-eb27-305b-80bd-c8be73360d85",
                                                "text": "Moreover, a perfect Medal has its Profile and out-ſtroaks ſharp (Nummus aſper) and by no means rugged; the Figures clean and well poliſh'd; the Contours neatly trimm'd, and exactly round and carefully preſerv'd; that the Extancy and Relievos correſpond with the Ingraving, and have not ſuffer'd in Percuſſion; in all which, there is a certain Spirit of Antiquity and Excellency to be diſcern'd in Antient Medals almoſt inimitable."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c4511b52-9627-462f-ac9e-21c31efa2c70",
                                                "sense_id": "94888005-eb27-305b-80bd-c8be73360d85",
                                                "text": "Sterling himself, though he had the most picturesque and inimitable vocabulary of vituperation, was highly squeamish about ordinary smut or profanity. He had indeed that nice-Nelliness which is often characteristic of the Don Juan type."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d3a535c5-48c6-4032-902a-3a8344090f1b",
                                                "sense_id": "94888005-eb27-305b-80bd-c8be73360d85",
                                                "text": "Let's see you pay for your drink in your own inimitable fashion, huh? A song, Denton! How about it?"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "7a52b429-d7b8-47ec-acc0-ec2c318b3f68",
                        "source_entry_id": "1a51e42f-30b0-3d5c-9355-6e8b14456a13",
                        "source_sense_id": "d400d8ad-99b6-3f9d-b640-7f624bcf6301",
                        "target_lang_word": "unattainable",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "unattainable",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "bae8ba22-af02-38b0-a83a-8923361b423b",
                                        "entry_id": "1d4ba5f4-e63b-3dc0-b9f2-63fd217fadbc",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Impossible to attain or reach; unable to accomplish"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "68873a7f-9cc6-444f-839c-55cd4ef54fa4",
                                                "sense_id": "bae8ba22-af02-38b0-a83a-8923361b423b",
                                                "text": "Efficiency for the sake of efficiency, unchallenged authority conferred upon those who know well a few things and ignore everything else, disdain for the ordinary and humble elements that introduce happiness in our lives, worship of unattainable utopiae, are some of the features of the scheme which leads inevitably to the suppression of the eternal gifts bestowed by God upon every human person and to the frightful prospect of being ruled by what he vividly names “the Empire of the Insect.”"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "unattainable",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "ab2402ef-3e33-335e-95fe-f66db9c65f97",
                                        "entry_id": "388588e5-f7f4-3c2d-bbb2-195f425ea364",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Anything that cannot be attained."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
